{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港西餐選擇非常多，今次介紹的澳洲菜相當較少，最近有澳洲風情餐廳就推出了全新餐單，花足心機創作，別具風味。</p><p>另有手工薄餅店為了迎接佳節，亦推出了洋溢繽紛色彩的全新美饌，讓大家可以食住過節。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;優質食材入饌&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:14:56.316389+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:00:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T09:08:13.339287+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:08:13.339287+00:00","content_hash":"3d12b816f62bcdc3381d20f82afdc1e7c508fa56ec86935808b7638d5feea728","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}